# SCF-Neue Workspace Commands Reference

## Development Commands
### Core Development
- `pnpm dev` - Start Expo development server (port 8081)
- `pnpm web` - Start Expo Web development server
- `pnpm ios` - Run iOS app (includes Xcode version check)
- `pnpm android` - Run Android app
- `pnpm web:build` - Build web app for production
- `pnpm prebuild` - Generate native code before builds

### Platform-Specific Development
- `pnpm start:dev-client` - Start with dev client
- `pnpm web:serve` - Serve built web app
- `pnpm adb:reverse` - Reverse Android port forwarding

## Code Quality Commands
### Primary Workflow
- `pnpm check` - Format, lint, and type check (same as CI)
- `pnpm build` - Build all packages
- `pnpm format:fix` - Fix formatting with Biome
- `pnpm lint:fix` - Fix linting issues
- `pnpm typecheck` - TypeScript type checking

### Comprehensive Testing
- `pnpm test:all` - Full test suite (integration + build)
- `pnpm test:build` - Build verification
- `pnpm test:lint` - Lint and type check
- `pnpm test:deps` - Dependency checks
- `pnpm test:integration` - Integration testing
- `pnpm test:tamagui` - Tamagui-specific checks
- `pnpm test:performance` - Performance testing

## Supabase Commands
### Core Operations
- `pnpm supa start` - Start local Supabase
- `pnpm supa stop` - Stop local Supabase
- `pnpm supa status` - Check Supabase status
- `pnpm supa db reset` - Reset database (use with caution)

### Type Generation
- `pnpm supa:generate` - Generate types from local DB
- `pnpm supa:generate:remote` - Generate types from remote DB

### Development Tools
- `pnpm supa:studio` - Open Supabase Studio (http://127.0.0.1:54323)
- `pnpm supa:mailpit` - Open Mailpit (http://127.0.0.1:54324)

### Migration Management
- `pnpm supa migration:new <name>` - Create new migration
- `pnpm supa migration:up` - Apply migrations

## UI/Tamagui Commands
### UI Package Operations
- `pnpm ui:check` - Check UI package
- `pnpm ui:optimize` - Optimize UI package
- `pnpm ui:extract` - Extract UI components

### Tamagui Operations
- `pnpm tamagui:check` - Check Tamagui configuration
- `pnpm tamagui:upgrade` - Upgrade Tamagui packages
- `pnpm tamagui:upgrade:canary` - Upgrade to canary versions

## Build & Deployment
### Build Commands
- `pnpm build` - Build all packages
- `pnpm watch` - Watch mode for development
- `pnpm deploy` - Deploy application

### EAS Build Commands (Expo)
#### Development Builds
- `pnpm eas:build:dev:simulator:ios` - iOS simulator build
- `pnpm eas:build:dev:simulator:android` - Android simulator build
- `pnpm eas:build:dev:device:ios` - iOS device build
- `pnpm eas:build:dev:device:android` - Android device build
- `pnpm eas:build:dev:simulator:ios:local` - Local iOS simulator build

#### Staging Builds
- `pnpm eas:build:staging:ios` - iOS staging build
- `pnpm eas:build:staging:android` - Android staging build

#### Submit Commands
- `pnpm eas:submit:dev:ios` - Submit dev iOS build
- `pnpm eas:submit:dev:android` - Submit dev Android build
- `pnpm eas:submit:staging:ios` - Submit staging iOS build
- `pnpm eas:submit:staging:android` - Submit staging Android build

#### Update Commands
- `pnpm eas:update:dev:ios` - Update dev iOS app
- `pnpm eas:update:dev:android` - Update dev Android app
- `pnpm eas:update:staging:ios` - Update staging iOS app
- `pnpm eas:update:staging:android` - Update staging Android app

## Monorepo Management
### Dependency Management
- `pnpm check-deps` - Check dependency version consistency
- `pnpm check-circular-deps` - Check for circular dependencies

### Code Generation
- `pnpm generate` - Generate code using Turbo generators

### Validation
- `pnpm validate:migration` - Validate migration changes

## Package-Specific Commands
### Core Package (`@app/core`)
- `pnpm --filter @app/core build` - Build core package
- `pnpm --filter @app/core watch` - Watch core package
- `pnpm --filter @app/core check:type` - Type check core package

### UI Package (`@scaffald/neue-ui`)
- `pnpm --filter @scaffald/neue-ui build` - Build UI package
- `pnpm --filter @scaffald/neue-ui watch` - Watch UI package
- `pnpm --filter @scaffald/neue-ui check` - Check UI package
- `pnpm --filter @scaffald/neue-ui format:fix` - Format UI package

### Expo App (`expo-app`)
- `pnpm --filter expo-app start` - Start Expo app
- `pnpm --filter expo-app web` - Start web version
- `pnpm --filter expo-app ios` - Run iOS version
- `pnpm --filter expo-app android` - Run Android version

## Server Ports
- **Expo Dev Server**: http://localhost:8081
- **Supabase Local**: http://localhost:54321
- **Supabase Studio**: http://127.0.0.1:54323
- **Mailpit**: http://127.0.0.1:54324
- **Web Dev Server**: Expo Web (when using `pnpm web`)

## Best Practices
1. **Always use workspace commands** instead of direct package commands
2. **Run `pnpm check`** before committing changes
3. **Use `pnpm test:all`** for comprehensive validation
4. **Check server status** before suggesting operations
5. **Use platform-specific commands** for targeted development
6. **Leverage EAS commands** for production builds and deployments